    "detailed_description": "Free, easy to use &amp; efficient aim trainer.<br />\r\nImprove your aim on exercises made specifically for the game you wanna imrpove at!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn aim trainer created by players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs passionate gamers with a strong desire to improve, we naturally became interested in aim training.<br />\r\nAfter experimenting with various options, we realized that none of the existing aim trainers fully satisfied our needs. This is where the idea for AimX was born, a simple and intuitive aim trainer designed to provide players with exercises that are specifically tailored to the game they want to practice for.<br />\r\nPlayers don't need 10'000+ exercises but only the ones that will help them improve the most.<br />\r\nIn the long term, AimX will analyze each player\u2019s strengths and weaknesses to provide customized exercises.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe want AimX to interact with its community in the way we wish all games would:  listening to players, taking their feedback, needs and preferences into account to evolve in the right direction.",
    "about_the_game": "Free, easy to use &amp; efficient aim trainer.<br />\r\nImprove your aim on exercises made specifically for the game you wanna imrpove at!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn aim trainer created by players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs passionate gamers with a strong desire to improve, we naturally became interested in aim training.<br />\r\nAfter experimenting with various options, we realized that none of the existing aim trainers fully satisfied our needs. This is where the idea for AimX was born, a simple and intuitive aim trainer designed to provide players with exercises that are specifically tailored to the game they want to practice for.<br />\r\nPlayers don't need 10'000+ exercises but only the ones that will help them improve the most.<br />\r\nIn the long term, AimX will analyze each player\u2019s strengths and weaknesses to provide customized exercises.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe want AimX to interact with its community in the way we wish all games would:  listening to players, taking their feedback, needs and preferences into account to evolve in the right direction.",
